# HELP scylla_transport_connections_blocked Holds an incrementing counter with the CQL connections that were blocked before being processed due to threshold configured via uninitialized_connections_semaphore_cpu_concurrency. Blocks are normal when we have multiple connections initialized at once. If connections are timing out and this value is high it indicates either connections storm or unusually slow processing.
# TYPE scylla_transport_connections_blocked counter
scylla_transport_connections_blocked{shard="0"} 0
scylla_transport_connections_blocked{shard="1"} 0
scylla_transport_connections_blocked{shard="2"} 0
scylla_transport_connections_blocked{shard="3"} 0
